      <body>
         <head>"Excelsior"</head>
         <author>Bret Harte</author>
         <p rend="color(#000000)">{{GUTENBERG_LICENSE}}</p>
         <p rend="start color(#000000)">en-gutenberg-odts/h/HarteBret-Excelsior_2007.odt</p>
         <pb/>
         <div type="div1">
            <head>"Excelsior"</head>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>The shades of night were falling fast,</l>
               <l>As through an Eastern village passed</l>
               <l>A youth who bore, through dust and heat,</l>
               <l>A stencil-plate, that read complete—“SAPOLIO.”</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>CLEAN PAINT, OIL CLOTHS, FLOORS,</l>
               <l>WOOD WORK, TABLES &amp; SHELVES</l>
               <l>
                  <hi rend="italic">with Sapolio</hi>.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>His brow was sad, but underneath,</l>
               <l>White with “Odonto” shone his teeth,</l>
               <l>And through them hissed the words, “Well, blow</l>
               <l>Me tight if here is ’ary show!”    “SAPOLIO.”</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>WASH DISHES, PORCELAIN, CHINA</l>
               <l>&amp; GLASS WARE</l>
               <l>
                  <hi rend="italic">with Sapolio</hi>.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>On household fences, gleaming bright,</l>
               <l>Shone “Gargling Oil,” in black and white,</l>
               <l>Once “Bixby’s Blacking” stood alone,</l>
               <l>He straight beside it clapped his own—“SAPOLIO.”</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>POLISH MILK CANS &amp; PANS</l>
               <l>AND ALL KINDS OF TIN WARE</l>
               <l>
                  <hi rend="italic">with Sapolio</hi>.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>“Try not my fence,” the old man said,</l>
               <l>“With ‘Mustang Liniment’ ’tis spread,</l>
               <l>Another vacant spot thar aint.”</l>
               <l>He answered with a dash of paint—“SAPOLIO.”</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>CLEAN STEEL KNIVES &amp; FORKS AND ALL</l>
               <l>METALLIC TOOLS AND UTENSILS</l>
               <l>
                  <hi rend="italic">with Sapolio</hi>.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>“O, stay,” the maiden said, “A rest</l>
               <l>Pray give us! What with ‘Bixby’s Best,’</l>
               <l>And ‘Simmons’ Pills,’ we’re like to die.”</l>
               <l>He only answered, “Will you try—SAPOLIO?”</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>CLEAN BATH TUBS, WASH BASINS</l>
               <l>AND SINKS</l>
               <l>
                  <hi rend="italic">with Sapolio</hi>.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>“Beware them peaks! That wall so bright</l>
               <l>Is but a snow bank, gleaming white,</l>
               <l>Your paint wont stick!” Came the reply,</l>
               <l>“I’ve done it! ‘How is that for high?’”    “SAPOLIO.”</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>SCOUR POTS, KETTLES, PANS</l>
               <l>&amp; ALL BRASS &amp; COPPER UTENSILS</l>
               <l>
                  <hi rend="italic">with Sapolio</hi>.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>One Sabbath morn, as heavenward</l>
               <l>White Mountain tourists slowly spurred,</l>
               <l>On ev’ry rock, to their dismay,</l>
               <l>They read that legend strange, alway—“SAPOLIO”</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>CLEAN GLASS WARE, WINDOWS,</l>
               <l>PORCELAIN &amp; CHINA WARES</l>
               <l>
                  <hi rend="italic">with Sapolio</hi>.</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>There on the summit, old and fat,</l>
               <l>Shameless, but vigorous, he sat,</l>
               <l>While on their luggage as they passed,</l>
               <l>He checked that word, from first to last,    “SAPOLIO.”</l>
            </lg>
            <p rend="justify">image</p>
            <lg>
               <l>CLEAN MARBLE TABLES, FLOORS,</l>
               <l>STATUARY AND HARD FINISHED WALLS</l>
               <l>
                  <hi rend="italic">with Sapolio</hi>.</l>
            </lg>
         </div>
